<title>USA: Stanford Telecom sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Stanford Telecom sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stanford Telecommunications Inc on Wednesday said its board declared a two-for-one stock split in the form of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record at the close of business on Feb. 10 will be issued one additional share of common stock for each share already held.</p>
<p>Such shares will be paid on February 28.</p>
</text>
